  "question": "What gallery are located within 60 kilometers in the direction of travel from Steinhart Aquarium, CA to the Wright Institute, Berkeley, CA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.465976 37.769485)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.253167 37.868383)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'gallery'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.465976 37.769485)',4326)::geography, 60000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.465976 37.769485)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
